  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\n**Given equation: **48 ÷ 3 + 12 × 4 – 6 × 7 + 21 = 27\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the numbers:\n\nOption 1) 3 and 4\n\n48 ÷ 3 + 12 × 4 – 6 × 7 + 21 = 27 ⇒ 48 ÷ 4 + 12 × 3 – 6 × 7 + 21 = 27\n\n⇒ __**48 ÷ 4**__ + 12 × 3 – 6 × 7 + 21 = 27\n\n⇒ 12 + __**12 × 3**__ – __**6 × 7**__ + 21 = 27\n\n⇒ __**12 + 36 + 21**__ – 42 = 27\n\n⇒ __69** – 42**__ = 27\n\n⇒&",
